<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Text Formatting</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Text Formatting in HTML</h1>

    <p>This is <b>Bold Text</b>.</p>

    <p>This is <i>Italic Text</i>.</p>

    <p>This is <u>Underlined Text</u>.</p>

    <p>Water is represented as H<sub>2</sub>O.</p>

    <p>2<sup>2</sup> = 4</p>

</body>
</html>
